        "sheet_number": "E-601",
        "title": "ELECTRICAL ONE-LINE DIAGRAM",
        "discipline": "electrical_engineering",
        "reading_notes": "Single-sheet electrical one-line diagram for HRSD Boat Harbor Treatment Plant. Shows complete medium-voltage/low-voltage power distribution tree. Main service is 1250A/480V/3Ø from Dominion Energy (incoming conduits per Construction Note F) through a CT cabinet and 1250A enclosed circuit breaker at 65kAIC. Main switchboard feeds: (1) Crane circuit 300A/480V/3Ø — appears twice, possibly north and south crane circuits; (2) NSDL 125A/480V/3Ø; (3) Dewatering 400A/480V/3Ø; (4) North WLSI 300A/480V/3Ø. Two 225kVA transformers (480/208/120V) feed downstream panels: Panel 'INSIDE' 900A/208V/3Ø/4W and Panel 'NORTH H WLS?' 600A/208V/3Ø/4W. Six pump feeders, each 125A/480V/3Ø enclosed circuit breakers (Pumps 1–6). Wire trough shown at top. Construction notes specify conductor sizing: 3 sets of 3-600KCMIL 1-#1/0 AWG GND in 4-inch conduit for main service; branch circuit conductors range from 350KCMIL down to #1/0 AWG. Drawing title block stamps: BFA project engineer seal dated 9/7/2023. SHEET 1 OF 1. The 'WIRE HOLD' annotation on main bus may indicate a hold/pending item at time of issue. Client label reads 'HAMPTON ROADS SANITATION DISTRICT.' Location label reads 'NORFOLK, VA.' Firm is Bowman Foster & Associates, Inc. (abbreviated 'BFA' in industry context), Norfolk and Alexandria offices."
      }
    ],
